{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/990c3e5fd2af864d949339594b9148f7.poster.avif?t=1758904380\" width=672 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/990c3e5fd2af864d949339594b9148f7.webm?t=1758904380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/990c3e5fd2af864d949339594b9148f7.mp4?t=1758904380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig Dig Burrito is about a burrito inside a burrito digging through all the delicious ingredients inside<strong>\ud83c\udf2f.\u00a0</strong>But you must be careful some ingredients can kill you! You will encounter many different enemies that try to kill you. You'll also choose between many different types of burritos that have drastically different gameplay. Also every burrito is unique and has many different types ingredients, some good some bad.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/49bc601735091ac72eb589ab63ff2ab3.webp?t=1758904380\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/85d0cd327aca99347867e554022f711d.poster.avif?t=1758904380\" width=672 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/85d0cd327aca99347867e554022f711d.webm?t=1758904380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/85d0cd327aca99347867e554022f711d.mp4?t=1758904380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 6 difficulty levels that you can play through. Every three burritos you dig through you get to choose between ending your run with what you have, or dig through another 3 burritos and play at a slightly higher difficulty level. You will also get the option after every 3 burritos to choose one of the many different randomly chosen unique burritos. If you choose a unique burrito you have the possibility to gain significantly more points, but at a HIGHER RISK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/e996982ef9356cee244a468e89b83e8a.webp?t=1758904380\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/fd95a0c0b6f0ca9c496659a427af37c3.poster.avif?t=1758904380\" width=672 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/fd95a0c0b6f0ca9c496659a427af37c3.webm?t=1758904380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/fd95a0c0b6f0ca9c496659a427af37c3.mp4?t=1758904380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 upgrades that dramatically change the game! Bigger explosions\ud83d\udca5, Double your points when digging, and More health\u2764\ufe0f. When the full game is released there will be a total of 6 upgrades and 3 special abilities. These will add a significant amount of gameplay to the game making it even more fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/85279172306407048ed75c2a0a291c70.webp?t=1758904380\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/3fe9c710ffdcf54d790d312ac25f0f54.poster.avif?t=1758904380\" width=674 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/3fe9c710ffdcf54d790d312ac25f0f54.webm?t=1758904380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bugs and other types of enemies to avoid death. If you touch an enemy you instantly die and lose all your progress! So make sure you take a safe path to avoid death.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/2d9f04e6d8a4f4244972a3a2b1638c4c.webp?t=1758904380\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/e37d1397b08cdbb7326f5fffba694dbc.poster.avif?t=1758904380\" width=672 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/e37d1397b08cdbb7326f5fffba694dbc.webm?t=1758904380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012190/extras/e37d1397b08cdbb7326f5fffba694dbc.mp4?t=1758904380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability! Everything is randomly generated! So no two runs are the same. In some runs you will get lucky and it will be easy and in others will be brutally hard!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012190?t=1758904380","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/